<view class="page page-with-fixed-back">
  <navigator url="/pages/me/me" class="back fixed-back" style="top: {{backTop}}px;" hover-class="none">‹ 返回</navigator>
  <block wx:if="{{!authorized}}">
    <view class="eyebrow auth-label">授权确认</view>
    <view class="title">允许慢聊小记整理你的记录吗？</view>
    <view class="body auth-copy">慢聊小记观察会从你的聊天和小记里，整理最近常出现的词。它只用于回看和自我记录，不做判断，也不做诊断。</view>
    <view class="auth-card card">
      <view class="auth-title">授权后，只统计你自己云端记录中实际出现的词。</view>
      <view class="body">不会调用 AI 猜测含义，也不会把这些内容作为心理诊断依据。你可以先不同意。</view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{errorText}}" class="error-card" aria-live="assertive">{{errorText}}</view>
    <button class="primary-button auth-button" bindtap="authorize">{{isAuthenticated ? "同意并查看真实观察" : "登录后查看真实观察"}}</button>
    <navigator url="/pages/me/me" class="secondary-button auth-secondary" hover-class="none">暂时不授权</navigator>
  </block>
  <block wx:else>
    <view class="title">慢聊小记观察</view>
    <view class="body intro">从聊天和小记里整理出最近常出现的词。<br />它不是判断，也不是答案。</view>
    <view class="muted tone-help">只展示实际出现次数，不给词贴情绪标签。</view>
    <view class="eyebrow range-title">观察范围</view>
    <view class="range-row">
      <button wx:for="{{ranges}}" wx:key="key" disabled="{{isLoading}}" class="{{range === item.key ? 'active' : ''}}" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="changeRange">{{item.label}}</button>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{isLoading}}" class="observation-state" aria-live="polite">正在整理你的记录…</view>
    <view wx:elif="{{errorText}}" class="observation-state error-card" aria-live="assertive">{{errorText}}<button bindtap="changeRange" data-key="{{range}}">重新加载</button></view>
    <view wx:elif="{{words.length === 0}}" class="observation-state card">
      <view class="empty-title">这段时间还没有足够的文字记录</view>
      <text>写下或聊过一些内容后，这里才会出现真实统计。</text>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{!isLoading && !errorText && words.length > 0}}" class="word-grid">
      <view wx:for="{{words}}" wx:key="word" class="word">
        <text>{{item.word}}</text><text>{{item.countText}}</text>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{words.length > 0}}" class="quote-card card">
      <view>这不是判断，只是出现次数。</view>
      <text>本范围统计了 {{sourceCounts.notes}} 条小记和 {{sourceCounts.userMessages}} 条你发出的聊天消息。</text>
    </view>
  </block>
</view>
